   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Explain how this tessellation of equilateral triangles could be produced.<br>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/01e98f7a08ee48e9.png\" alt=\"A tessellation pattern is made up of two rows of equilateral triangles. Each row has 6 triangles and 6 inverted triangles.\">\n</figure>",
